# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Request-service form delivery
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The form ships without a backend. Set this to any endpoint that accepts a
# JSON POST and you are live (no server code needed).
#
# Easiest options:
#   1. Formspree  -> https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx      (free tier, emails you)
#   2. Basin      -> https://usebasin.com/f/xxxxxxxx
#   3. Zapier/Make webhook -> https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/...
#   4. Your own API route  -> /api/lead
#
# Payload sent:
#   { name, phone, service, urgency, details, page, submittedAt }
#
# Without this set, the form still validates and shows the confirmation screen
# (which pushes the visitor to tap-to-call), but nothing is delivered to you.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
